## Implementation Examples

### Example 1: Story Creation Workflow

```xml
<step n="8" goal="Auto-update tracking documents">
  <action>Update {output_folder}/bmm-workflow-status.md:</action>
  - current_step: "create-story (Story 1.1)"
  - current_workflow: "create-story - Complete"
  - progress_percentage: 45% (was 40%, +5% for story creation)
  - decisions_log: "2025-10-18: Created story 1.1 (Privacy Consent Prompt). Status: Draft. Next: Run *story-ready to approve for development."

  <action>Update story file status/story-1.1.md:</action>
  - Status: "Draft"
  - Last Updated: "2025-10-18T10:30:00Z"
  - Change Log: "2025-10-18: Story created by SM agent (Bob). Includes 5 ACs, 8 tasks, context references."

  <output>✅ Story Creation Complete!

**Story Details:**
- ID: 1.1
- Title: Privacy Consent Prompt
- Status: Draft

**Tracking Updated:**
- bmm-workflow-status.md: ✅ Updated
- story-1.1.md: ✅ Created
- Epic 1 (Foundation): 0/5 stories (0%)

**Progress:**
- Overall: 45%
- Current Step: create-story (Story 1.1)

**Next Recommended Action:**
Run *story-ready to approve story 1.1 for development.</output>
</step>
```

### Example 2: Story Development Complete

