  - current_step: "dev-story (Story 1.1)"
  - current_workflow: "dev-story - Complete (Ready for Review)"
  - progress_percentage: 65% (was 45%, +20% for dev-story)
  - decisions_log: "2025-10-20: Completed dev-story for Story 1.1 (Privacy Consent Prompt). All tasks complete, tests passing (85% coverage). Status: Ready for Review. Next: User reviews and runs story-approved when satisfied."

