  - Privacy Compliance: Consent prompt implemented ✅

  <output>✅ Story Development Complete!

**Story Details:**
- ID: 1.1
- Title: Privacy Consent Prompt
- Status: Draft → Ready for Review
- Coverage: 85% (✅ Exceeds 80% minimum)

**Tracking Updated:**
