## Status Transitions

**Stories:**
- Created → Draft
- Approved for Dev → In Progress
- Dev Complete → Ready for Review
- Review Passed → Complete

**Epics:**
- Created → In Progress (when first story starts)
- All Stories Complete → Complete

**Phases (Toubkal):**
- Week 0 → Phase 1 (when all Week 0 tasks complete)
- Phase 1 → Phase 2 (when all Phase 1 stories complete)

